Package: agentail
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-tomlkit
Recommends: gnome-shell (>= 45), openssh-client
Suggests: python3-gi, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1
Maintainer: Tianwei Ye <tianweiye@u.nus.edu>
Homepage: https://github.com/YeTianwei/Agentail
Description: live status of AI coding agents on this desktop and your SSH servers
 Agentail installs a tiny hook into Claude Code and Codex. Hook events reach a
 daemon on your desktop (through an ssh -R tunnel for remote servers), and a
 GNOME Shell top bar panel shows which agents are running, which wait for you
 and which need permission.
 .
 After installing, run "agentail setup" as your normal user.
